-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ONNX Runtime (used, not redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RB Stems Plus does not ship ONNX Runtime. The Stems Cache bridge loads the copy
of ONNX Runtime 1.18 that comes with rekordbox, copied from rekordbox on the
user's own Mac. ONNX Runtime is Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, MIT License,
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime.

No file made by AlphaTheta or Pioneer DJ is distributed with RB Stems Plus.
Pioneer's files are only copied on the user's own Mac, so that uninstalling
Stems Cache can put rekordbox back exactly as it was.
